OL,3,GNEWSACouncil weighs into Falkland
OL,4,AIslands row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motion defending the Falkland
OL,7,FIslands' right to self-determination
OL,8,Fthat is set to go before Burnley
OL,9,FCouncil has been slammed by Reform UK,
OL,10,Fwhich has accused the authority's
OL,11,Fleader of "grandstanding".
OL,13,FThe issue of motions on topics that do
OL,14,Fnot directly impact the town's
OL,15,Fresidents have increasingly become a
OL,16,Fflashpoint between the different
OL,17,Fgroups, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,18,FService reports.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
