OL,3,GNEWSACouncil weighs into Falkland
OL,4,AIslands row
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform's councillor Gavin Theaker said
OL,7,Fthe council "exists to serve the
OL,8,Fborough of Burnley, not involve itself
OL,9,Fin international disputes".
OL,11,FBut Burnley leader Afrasiab Anwar said:
OL,12,F"Reform themselves have put forward
OL,13,Fmotions on matters of national policy".
